+// Loads an HTML document into a top-level traversable without a navigation: no UI process, no
+// fetch. The response is built in place from the given bytes, the way WebContent would receive it
+// for a file: URL, then the document becomes the traversable's active history entry. For embedders
+// that render pages in a single process.
+WEB_API GC::Ptr<DOM::Document> load_html_in_place(HTML::LocalTraversableNavigable&, URL::URL const&, ReadonlyBytes html, HTML::CrossProcessId);
+
+}
